@startuml
skinparam defaultFontName Microsoft YaHei
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam ArrowColor #54718B
skinparam classBackgroundColor #F3F8FC
skinparam classBorderColor #355C7D
skinparam componentBackgroundColor #F3F8FC
skinparam componentBorderColor #355C7D
skinparam stateBackgroundColor #F3F8FC
skinparam stateBorderColor #355C7D
skinparam nodesep 40
skinparam ranksep 45
title 交付数据及隐私快照
hide methods
class Address {
id: PK
owner_id / kind: 收货或发货
recipient / telephone
province / city / district / detail
is_default: 每人每用途唯一
}
class Reservation {
id: PK
product_id / buyer_id: FK
state / deadline
商品、价格、身份、图片快照
}
class DeliveryOrder {
reservation_id: PK, FK
mode / phase / legacy
goods_cents / freight_cents
receiver_json: 原始收货快照
shipped_at / received_at
handoff_requested_at
}
class AddressChange {
id: PK
reservation_id / proposer_id
address_json / state
handled_by / handled_at
}
class ShipmentEvent {
id: PK
reservation_id / actor_id
carrier / tracking_number
kind / reason / created_at
sender_json: 发货快照
}
class DeliveryIssue {
id: PK
reservation_id / opened_by
category / description / state
proposal / proposed_by
seller_received / handled_by
}
class DeliveryRequest {
reservation_id / actor_id / request_key: PK
fingerprint / result_json
}
Reservation "1" *-- "1" DeliveryOrder
DeliveryOrder "1" -- "0..*" AddressChange
DeliveryOrder "1" -- "0..*" ShipmentEvent
DeliveryOrder "1" -- "0..*" DeliveryIssue
DeliveryOrder "1" -- "0..*" DeliveryRequest
Address ..> DeliveryOrder : 创建时复制，不依赖原地址存续
Address ..> AddressChange : 复制后等待卖家确认
legend bottom
  原始金额、交付方式和收货快照不可更新；运单更正追加历史，不覆盖原记录。
  买家可查自己的收货信息；卖家仅在待交易期间可查必要收件信息，终结后隐藏。
  发货地址完整内容只属卖家，对方只见城市区县。日志、通知不含完整地址电话。
  旧预约只建立legacy面交关联，不伪造缺失的邮寄信息。
endlegend
@enduml
